  "Excellent trooper and support for the Swordsman style. A superb candidate for Corporal with the attack power to survive any tight situation. His motto: \"Always seek to profit.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた優秀な平隊士。伍長としては窮地を生き抜く攻撃力を発揮。座右の銘は「一攫千金」。",
  "Excellent trooper and support for the Swordsman style. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Always seek to profit.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた優秀な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「一攫千金」。",
  "A brilliant trooper and support for the Swordsman style. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Never betray your word.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた秀逸な平隊士。攻撃型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「有言実行」。",
  "One of the best troopers for the Swordsman style. A superb candidate for Corporal, thanks to excellent leadership skills. His motto: \"When life is hard, get harder.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた最も優秀な平隊士の一人。統率力の優れた伍長として適任。座右の銘は「金剛不壊」。",
  "Flexible trooper with a penchant for aiding Swordsmen. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Do what's never been done.\"": "一刀補佐に長けた汎用的な平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「破天荒」。",
  "Someone who knows how to keep enemies at a distance. Ill-suited for Corporal. His motto: \"Act with heart and mind as one.\"": "敵との距離を測る事に長けた平隊士。伍長には不向き。座右の銘は「誠心誠意」。",
  "Refuses to let the Heat drop or the drinks run dry. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal in a sword squad. His motto: \"Look before you leap.\"": "闘気の扱いに長けた平隊士。刀隊士を率いる攻撃型伍長として最適。座右の銘は「転ばぬ先の杖」。",
