  "Practically fit to be called the Wild Dancer's dancing partner. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Do what's never been done.\"": "乱舞補佐に長けた優秀な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「破天荒」。",
  "Disciplined shooter who knows how to spot for a fellow Gunman. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal. His motto? \"Shoot first, motto later.\"": "短銃補佐に長けた秀逸な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「平々凡々」。",
  "A standout talent who works best alongside a Gunman. A decent enough Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Keep a cool head.\"": "短銃補佐に長けた優秀な平隊士。攻撃型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「泰然自若」。",
  "Practically fit to be called the Wild Dancer's dancing partner. Makes for a trusty Offensive Corporal. His motto: \"Do not disturb.\"": "乱舞補佐に長けた秀逸な平隊士。攻撃型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「平穏無事」。",
