  "A truly intrepid Defensive Trooper. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Take everything one step at a time.\"": "守備型の平隊士として優秀。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「日進月歩」。",
  "A truly intrepid Defensive Trooper. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Maybe I'll get lucky someday.\"": "守備型の平隊士として優秀。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「棚からぼた餅」。",
  "Defensive Trooper who's damn hard to stun. A decent enough Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Even the crops learn to bow with respect.\"": "気絶耐性の高い守備型隊士。守備型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「実るほど首を垂れる稲穂かな」。",
  "A truly intrepid Defensive Trooper. A decent enough Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Let the past guide the future.\"": "守備型の平隊士として優秀。守備型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「温故知新」。",
  "A truly intrepid Defensive Trooper. Makes for a trusty Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Do not disturb.\"": "守備型の平隊士として優秀。守備型伍長として適任。座右の銘は「平穏無事」。",
  "Someone who knows how to keep enemies at a distance. Makes for a trusty Corporal, thanks to excellent leadership skills. His motto: \"Outer conduct, inner cultivation.\"": "敵との距離を測る事に長けた平隊士。統率力の優れた伍長として有能。座右の銘は「品行方正」。",
  "Defensive Trooper with a preternatural resistance to bullets. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Even the crops learn to bow with respect.\"": "射撃耐性の高い守備型隊士。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「実るほど首を垂れる稲穂かな」。",
  "An evasive little Defensive Trooper. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Pride makes the patriot.\"": "攻撃回避が優秀な守備型隊士。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「尽忠報国」。",
  "Defensive Trooper willing to do his best in any situation. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Pride makes the patriot.\"": "守備型の平隊士として汎用的。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「尽忠報国」。",
  "Defensive Trooper willing to do his best in any situation. A fine choice for Corporal with the strength to endure any hardship. His motto: \"Keep a cool head.\"": "守備型の平隊士として汎用的。伍長としては窮地を粘り強く耐え抜く。座右の銘は「泰然自若」。",
