  "A most ordinary trooper. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. His motto: \"Actions speak louder than words.\"": "平凡な平隊士。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「不言実行」。",
  "Defensive Trooper willing to do his best in any situation. A capable Corporal, though not without his own risks. Currently workshopping his motto.": "守備型の平隊士として汎用的。伍長とすれば有能だが、危険も伴う。座右の銘は「平々凡々」。",
