  "This one has a gift for armaments with the light element. A decent enough Defensive Corporal. His motto: \"Remember what set you on your journey.\"": "閃属性武器の扱いに秀逸な平隊士。守備型伍長としては凡庸。座右の銘は「初志貫徹」。",
