  "Talented Defensive Trooper. Makes for a trusty Corporal, thanks to excellent leadership skills. His motto: \"Solidarity is the key to victory.\"": "守備型の平隊士として秀逸。統率力の優れた伍長として適任。座右の銘は「一致団結」。",
